1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,142
Why couldn't mighty Bhima lift a single tail?

2
00:00:02,283 --> 00:00:05,401
During the exile, an old monkey lay across Bhima's path.

3
00:00:05,550 --> 00:00:07,541
Hey, monkey! Get out of my way!

4
00:00:07,783 --> 00:00:10,660
The monkey said: I am old, just move my tail aside and pass.

5
00:00:10,817 --> 00:00:14,245
Proudly, Bhima lifted the tail with one hand, but it didn't even move!

6
00:00:14,517 --> 00:00:17,088
He used both hands, all his strength, and still nothing!

7
00:00:17,417 --> 00:00:19,364
That old monkey was Hanuman Ji himself!

8
00:00:19,983 --> 00:00:22,711
Bhima touched his feet, and Hanuman Ji blessed him.

9
00:00:22,850 --> 00:00:23,207
The lesson.

10
00:00:23,337 --> 00:00:25,670
However strong we are, we must stay humble.

11
00:00:26,050 --> 00:00:28,189
For more stories like this, Subscribe!
